Copyright (C) 2026 Yukishiro (@yksr_melt / @yksr-melt).
Upstream: https://github.com/yksr-melt/Meltype
Source references: linux/ibus-engine-meltype, src/Meltype.Mac.Native/Exports.cs,
src/Meltype.Core/Composition/MeltypeSession.cs,
native/mozc/meltype_mozc_helper.cc (in-process bridge adaptation).
The addon and tests were added in 2026 for this fork.

The source repository does not vendor Fcitx, Mozc or NativeAOT binaries.
Android APK packaging includes the explicitly supplied NativeAOT provider and
links a static Mozc bridge; retain THIRD-PARTY-NOTICES.md with the APK assets.
Fcitx is linked through its public API; the provider library and Mozc helper
are supplied separately. Preserve their original licenses and third-party
notices when distributing a combined package. Meltype's third-party notices
are available in its source repository and release distributions.
